Z||000000||BN Boomer||07-08-2000||01:46 PM||||Well this what it's been looking like lately at quitting time at Delta Yard. This pic was taken at about 5am as my crew was finishing a transfer move between yards. The sun coming up over the North Cascades is just awesome. I never get tired of looking at it. I love being able to work outdoors and have experiences like this. I don't even mind the rain or snow at other times of the year. There is something beautiful to see outside all of the time. I don't know what I would do if I was caged up in an office all day. <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/boomers_fiero_files/delta1.jpg">  <P>And just for kicks, here's a pic of my Suburban near Cle Elum, Wa. Man I love getting out in the country.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/boomers_fiero_files/cleelum.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by BN Boomer (edited 07-08-2000).]||||reg||1
