Z||000003||BAM-BAM||07-09-2000||03:37 PM||||  You know, I grew up in Oregon just southeast of portland in the Molalla, Colton area and for the past 20 years i have lived here in the desert southwest. Those pictures really make me home sick. My wife lived in Clarkston Wa. as a kid. If only I could make the money there that I enjoy here I would move in a heartbeat. Also, there is really nothing for our kids to do here. Well thanks for the recolections; now I must go feal sad and depressed. Bye  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P> bam out~||||reg||9
